<Window xmlns="https://github.com/avaloniaui"
        xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
        x:Class="MoTuPerf.Desktop.ChangelogWindow"
        Title="更新日志"
        Width="700"
        SizeToContent="Height"
        MaxHeight="640"
        MinWidth="620"
        CanResize="False"
        WindowDecorations="BorderOnly"
        ExtendClientAreaToDecorationsHint="True"
        ExtendClientAreaTitleBarHeightHint="0"
        WindowStartupLocation="CenterOwner">
  <Border Classes="secondaryWindowFrame">
    <Grid RowDefinitions="48,*,58">
      <Border Grid.Row="0" Classes="dialogTitleBar" PointerPressed="DialogTitlePointerPressed">
        <Grid ColumnDefinitions="*,46">
          <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="24,0,0,0">
            <TextBlock Text="&#xE8A5;" Foreground="{DynamicResource Theme.Accent}" FontSize="18" FontFamily="Segoe MDL2 Assets, sans-serif" Margin="0,0,10,0" />
            <TextBlock Text="更新日志" Classes="sectionTitle" />
          </StackPanel>
          <Button Grid.Column="1" Classes="windowButton closeButton" Content="&#x00D7;" Click="CloseWindow" ToolTip.Tip="关闭" />
        </Grid>
      </Border>
      <ScrollViewer Grid.Row="1" VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled">
          <StackPanel Margin="22,10,18,12" Spacing="9">
          <Border Classes="helpSection">
            <StackPanel>
              <TextBlock Text="v0.42.0" Classes="helpTitle" />
              <TextBlock Text="2026-09-30" Classes="dialogHint" />
              <TextBlock Classes="helpBody" TextWrapping="Wrap" Text="• 优化长时间采集性能：采集过程中隐藏“分析数据”页签并停止重复扫描全部历史样本，停止采集或导入现场文件后再计算完整统计；UI 刷新缓冲增加有界无损背压，避免界面卡顿时队列无限增长。&#xA;• 优化参数面板页签布局：采集中隐藏“分析数据”后，“实时数据”和“选中数据”自动各占一半宽度；停止采集或导入数据后恢复三个等宽页签，不再留下空白列。" />
            </StackPanel>
          </Border>
          <Border Classes="helpSection">
            <StackPanel>
              <TextBlock Text="v0.41.3" Classes="helpTitle" />
              <TextBlock Text="2026-09-29" Classes="dialogHint" />
              <TextBlock Classes="helpBody" TextWrapping="Wrap" Text="• 修复 Windows GitHub Actions 与本地换行格式不一致导致桌面 UI 契约测试误报失败的问题，统一源码读取的换行处理。&#xA;• 发布版本提升至 v0.41.3，重新触发 Windows 安装包和 macOS Apple Silicon DMG 的自动构建。" />
            </StackPanel>
          </Border>
          <Border Classes="helpSection">
            <StackPanel>
              <TextBlock Text="v0.41.2" Classes="helpTitle" />
              <TextBlock Text="2026-09-29" Classes="dialogHint" />
              <TextBlock Classes="helpBody" TextWrapping="Wrap" Text="• 完善鸿蒙温度曲线的帮助说明，解释 ambient、Battery、charger、rfboard、shell_back、shell_frame、shell_front 和 system_h 的含义。&#xA;• 明确这些数据是设备级传感器温度，单位为 °C，不是所选进程温度，也不等同于 CPU/GPU 芯片温度；同时说明厂商差异、缺失数据和跨设备对比边界。&#xA;• 修复无鸿蒙真机的 CI 环境执行平台测试时，真机探针被误判为失败的问题；设置设备序列号后仍会执行完整真机验证。" />
            </StackPanel>
          </Border>
        </StackPanel>
      </ScrollViewer>
      <Border Grid.Row="2" Classes="dialogFooter">
        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" HorizontalAlignment="Right" VerticalAlignment="Center" Spacing="8">
          <Button Classes="helpLinkButton" Content="查看完整在线更新日志" Click="OpenVersionLog" ToolTip.Tip="打开完整在线更新日志" />
          <Button Classes="primaryToolbarButton" Content="知道了" Click="CloseWindow" Width="104" Margin="0,0,18,0" />
        </StackPanel>
      </Border>
    </Grid>
  </Border>
</Window>
